Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.43,0:00:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I hope you're all\Nenjoying your holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.71,0:00:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, were you up late again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.41,0:00:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, for a mechatronics\Nproject for school. Mecha-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.67,0:00:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds fun.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.26,0:00:23.02,Tokyo,,0,0,0,,{\pos(133.5,258)\blur1.2\fnOpen Sans Light\fscx51\fscy51\frz1.8\c&HE9F1EF&\b0}Tokyo
