Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.41,0:00:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kazuto, you see this yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.01,0:00:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.03,0:00:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Holy Sword Excalibur\Nhas been found in ALO?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, that sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.45,0:00:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe someone\Nelse beat us to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.29,0:00:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Read the article, Doofus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.93,0:00:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says it's been found is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.45,0:00:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's actually got it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.31,0:00:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.65,0:00:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't scare me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.21,0:00:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A couple months ago on the Arun Plains,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.15,0:00:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leafa, Yui, and me got swallowed\Nby a big-ass monster worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.77,0:00:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It dropped us in an underground\Nrealm called Jotunheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.35,0:00:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We looked around for a bit and came\Nacross this four-armed humanoid monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.71,0:00:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was fighting another\Nmonster that looked
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.57,0:01:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like a cross between an\Nelephant and a jellyfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.65,0:01:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.09,0:01:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leafa felt sorry for the jellyphant\Nthing and told me to go save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.41,0:01:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lured forearms onto this frozen\Nlake and it fell through the ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.93,0:01:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the jellyphant took care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.61,0:01:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leafa decided to call it Tonki.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.65,0:01:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and suddenly it transformed into an even\Nweirder-looking thing with eight wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.65,0:01:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We hopped on its back and it took us to a\Npassageway, leading to the surface world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.71,0:01:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the way up was when we saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.27,0:01:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An upside-down pyramid hanging\Nfrom the roots of the world tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.45,0:01:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a long golden sword shimmering inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.43,0:01:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excalibur.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.39,0:01:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was planning on going back\Nfor it someday, but now...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.93,0:01:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be a nice break from all that\Nfloor-clearing you're doing in New Aincrad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.79,0:01:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This article doesn't say\Nanything about how they found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.87,0:02:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Players can't fly in Jotunheim, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.23,0:02:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's the only way to spot Excalibur.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing's too high up to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.73,0:02:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless they rescued\None of Tonki's friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.97,0:02:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hitched a ride, and\Ntriggered the quest flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.89,0:02:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we could do it, so could someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.41,0:02:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that makes sense, although...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.83,0:02:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who'd trust a creepy...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.67,0:02:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I mean, who'd trust such a unique\Nmonster unless they had weird tape?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, a weirdly big heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.39,0:02:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone just like you, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.11,0:02:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are the odds?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.02,0:02:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.03,0:02:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.99,0:02:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the whole point of showing\Nyou that was to get you going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.17,0:02:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time before someone
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.05,0:02:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,grinds through that\Ndungeon and gets the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.51,0:02:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.57,0:02:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clock's ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.19,0:02:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what are you going to do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.07,0:02:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugu, getting rare items\Nisn't the point of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.87,0:02:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's all you play\Nfor, you're missing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.67,0:02:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.67,0:02:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's funner things to\Ndo than boosting stats.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.13,0:02:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.41,0:03:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think Tonki wanted us to find it, and\Nthat's why he showed us where it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.55,0:03:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason, he needs\Nus to clear that dungeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.07,0:03:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's up to us to\Nmake his wish come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.37,0:03:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tonki's our friend, and there's no\Nway I'm turning my back on a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.93,0:03:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.21,0:03:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A minute ago, you called\Nyour friend creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.79,0:03:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I meant creepy cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.35,0:03:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.05,0:03:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.96,0:03:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have practice\Nbecause of the holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.95,0:03:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.89,0:03:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll need seven others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.65,0:03:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to overload Tonki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.19,0:03:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For starters, we got you, me, and Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.77,0:03:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then there's Klein, Liz, and Silica.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.61,0:03:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need one more person.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.37,0:03:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eggiel's gotta work tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.35,0:03:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chris Height's not leveled up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.87,0:03:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rekon's grinding in Sylph territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.87,0:03:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.11,0:03:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's ask Sinon to come along!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great idea, sis! What did you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.15,0:03:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll message him right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.87,0:03:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except for Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.31,0:03:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave that to you. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.33,0:04:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could see Kirito again\Nbefore I go visit my grandparents.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.45,0:04:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morning, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.61,0:04:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to call so early.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.49,0:04:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were planning on going on\Na quest in ALO this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.05,0:04:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.43,0:04:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll totally go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.83,0:04:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm free all day today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.13,0:04:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll text you the time and\Nplace, so keep an eye out for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.15,0:04:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you in a little while, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.09,0:04:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.57,0:04:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.47,0:04:50.10,OP-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}I've been walking in the light all this time
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.47,0:04:50.10,OP-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k39\blur2}Zu{\k41}tto {\k17}hi{\k19}ka{\k29}ri {\k30}no {\k32}na{\k45}ka {\k16}ki{\k16}no{\k48}u {\k13}ma{\k18}de {\k27}wa {\k35}na{\k29}ka{\k109}tta
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.87,0:04:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen the light on the sky.
