Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.31,0:04:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.39,0:05:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen the rain.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.94,0:05:03.74,OP-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}I have no regrets at all
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.94,0:05:03.74,OP-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k23\blur2}Ko{\k16}u{\k31}ka{\k32}i {\k44}mo {\k44}na{\k14}ni {\k46}mo {\k18}na{\k29}i {\k30}ke{\k53}do
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.11,0:05:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.57,0:05:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen the sound.
