Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.94,0:06:06.94,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,765)\blur3\bord6\fs180\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\alpha&H22&}Queen Of The Lake
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.67,0:06:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Klein, do you get to\Ntake vacation for New Year's?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.19,0:06:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Been on it since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.11,0:06:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I wanted to work and I don't,\Nthere's no shipments this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what my cheap-ass boss said?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.99,0:06:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be thankful you got a job where you\Nget a whole week off for New Year's,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.21,0:06:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bragging about it like\Nhe was doing us a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.93,0:06:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And speaking of favors,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.67,0:06:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if we do manage to snag Excalibur today,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.11,0:06:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about doing me a solid and help me\Nget my hands on the Soul Blade Kaguzuchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.65,0:06:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.56,0:06:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That dungeon's like a freaking oven, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.43,0:06:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I'm going\Nto Jotunheim for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.43,0:06:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where it's colder than\Nthe ass end of an ice pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.57,0:06:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I want something\Nout of this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.59,0:06:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Shekinah bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.63,0:06:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your avatar's two weeks old, and already\Nyou're gunning for a legendary weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.23,0:06:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, that bow Liz\Nmade me as great and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.09,0:07:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I need something\Nwith a little more range.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.49,0:07:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what the heck are you\Nusing a bow and A .L .O. for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.43,0:07:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their range falls between\Nthe spears and magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.79,0:07:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're like the only player who wants to\Nuse these things to snipe from 100 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.43,0:07:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had my way, I'd want\Ndouble that range at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.43,0:07:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're back! Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.91,0:07:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.27,0:07:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We thought you were never\Ncoming back. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.45,0:07:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get lost or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.11,0:07:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.13,0:07:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were gathering\Ninformation while we shopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.61,0:07:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We talked to a whole\Nbunch of people, Daddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.55,0:07:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and so far not one player or party\Nhas reached that dungeon yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.29,0:07:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then how the heck do\Nthey know where Excalibur's at?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.97,0:07:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the thing, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.47,0:07:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one really knows where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently they found a different\Nquest than the one Tonki showed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.59,0:07:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They met an NPC who told them if\Nthey finished this other quest,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.45,0:07:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'd get Excalibur as the reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.47,0:07:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And from what we heard, the quest\Nthey're going on isn't very pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.27,0:08:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of a delivery quest or an\Nescort quest, it's a kill quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.49,0:08:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just slaughtering monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.35,0:08:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone in Jotunheim is out there\Nright now killing as many as they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that doesn't even sound\Nclose to being pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.41,0:08:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole thing sounds\Nsketchy to me, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.29,0:08:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's what we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.67,0:08:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a dungeon in the sky with\NExcalibur locked up at the bottom of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.35,0:08:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To get to it, you gotta fight your\Nway through a bunch of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.07,0:08:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now we got an NPC offering\Nit up as a kill quest reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.81,0:08:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's bizarre now that you\Nmention it? That is weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.39,0:08:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The NBC is not showing anyone to the\Ndungeon, but that's where the sword is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.89,0:08:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure we'll find\Nout why once we get there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.05,0:08:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alrighty, your weapons are all\Nrestored and ready for action.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.17,0:09:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though our party's full of hotness,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.27,0:09:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're still a bunch of\Ngear-toting meatheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.65,0:09:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to switch it up, you\Ncould always boost your magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.55,0:09:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha! Keep dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.41,0:09:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A real samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.37,0:09:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't be caught dead using magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.97,0:09:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Code of Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.21,0:09:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Code of Honor, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.93,0:09:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know what samurais are\Nclassified as in RPGs?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.65,0:09:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're both warriors and\Nblack magic users. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.21,0:09:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather bust my sword and quit\Nbeing a samurai than use magic, doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.13,0:09:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Klein.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.23,0:09:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I remember, Red, didn't you use\Na flame sword skill the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.21,0:09:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, when you activate\Nit, you are using part magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.29,0:09:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way! Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.87,0:09:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Klein, what Silica said is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.93,0:09:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember the Mei update?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.63,0:09:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It brought a whole bunch\Nof new sword skills to ALO.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.07,0:09:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some are physical and others\Nare advanced, like Earth, Water,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.13,0:09:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire, Wind, Dark, and Divine, all\Nof which are magical attributes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.01,0:09:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire is magical too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.51,0:09:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, ex-samurai, you need\Nhelp busting that sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.05,0:10:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, back me up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.47,0:10:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, since you don't chant when using\Nsword skills, I guess it's not the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.17,0:10:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let it slide this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.69,0:10:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate you guys\Nhelping me out on such short notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.81,0:10:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, you don't know\Nhow much this means to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.93,0:10:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, are you ready? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.15,0:10:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.06,0:10:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many steps does\Nthis thing have, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.55,0:10:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet the tower on the\Ndungeon floor of New
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.73,0:10:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ein Kirito doesn't even\Nhave as many as this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.91,0:10:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.15,0:10:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.25,0:10:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we took the normal route to\NJotunheim, it'd take at least two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.89,0:10:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way, it's just five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.11,0:10:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of complaining about the steps,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.05,0:10:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should be thanking me for\Nshowing you guys this rad shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.85,0:10:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.57,0:10:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still a pain in the butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.99,0:10:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got your pain in the butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.41,0:11:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dumbass, do that again, and you\Nget a fire arrow in your pie hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.41,0:11:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brother, you got balls of steel, no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.17,0:11:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wowzers! Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.81,0:11:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now aren't you cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.47,0:11:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oath, sharl, raise,\Nbend, bard, harp, stools!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.91,0:11:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.01,0:11:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cast a freeze resistance spell over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.45,0:12:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tonki! Up here! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.85,0:12:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.91,0:12:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Klein.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.39,0:12:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't look it, but he's a vegetarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.01,0:12:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.65,0:12:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I brought him some fish from above\Nground, he scarfed it all down in one bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.47,0:12:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's telling you to\Nget on his back is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.17,0:12:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, no way, no way in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My grandpa's dying\Nwords were don't ride in
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.67,0:12:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,foreign cars or on\Nflying Cthulhu elephants.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.23,0:12:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he the same dead grandpa who's dried
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.61,0:12:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,figs we were eating at\NDicey's the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.45,0:12:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop farting around and get on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.99,0:12:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It eats me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:12:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.27,0:12:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're so dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.81,0:12:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot for doing this, Tonki.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.87,0:13:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Tonki.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.45,0:13:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's on board, so\Ntake us to that dungeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.53,0:13:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.44,0:13:25.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what would happen\Nif you fell from way up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.85,0:13:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same thing that happened\Nwhen a certain someone decided to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.77,0:13:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get to the next level of Aincrad\Nby climbing the Outer Pillars.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.03,0:13:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how bad at Wonderplutz?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.45,0:13:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Care to show the lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.53,0:13:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, I think I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.03,0:13:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But maybe one of our more cat-like\Nfriends would like to take a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.61,0:13:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, nope, nope, nope, nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.67,0:13:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.53,0:13:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.65,0:13:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.87,0:13:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.19,0:14:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kazuto, get up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.49,0:14:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.17,0:14:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My god.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.13,0:14:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.93,0:14:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They figured out how to make\Nthat monster fight for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.85,0:14:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, there's got to be another reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.71,0:14:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not possible to tame\Nmonsters in this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.37,0:14:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even if you're a\Ncatsy master tamer with
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.63,0:14:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a full power boost and special equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.65,0:14:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then they're leeching off the monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.87,0:14:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait, they're not leeching.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.11,0:14:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piggybacking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.02,0:14:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it. See,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.29,0:14:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that group's got old forearms\Nthere doing all the heavy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.91,0:14:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lifting and sniping at the\NJelliphant when they get an opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.85,0:14:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But is it that easy to\Ncontrol a monster's aggro?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.39,0:14:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's ignoring everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.41,0:15:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come they're not taking\Non that forearm, dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.91,0:15:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's everyone going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.87,0:15:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.69,0:15:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.81,0:15:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After what we just saw and how it went down,\Nit should be pretty obvious what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.21,0:15:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but we're looking at\Nthat kill quest Asuna told us about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.39,0:15:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's a quest,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.87,0:15:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,helping these forearmed freaks\Nmurder Tonki's friends is disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.85,0:15:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, she's tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.79,0:15:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greetings, I am Urd, Queen of the Lake!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have bonded with my\Nkinsmen and I am grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.01,0:15:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My two younger sisters and\NI have spoken at length.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.37,0:15:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we have a request for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.47,0:16:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you would be so kind, we ask that you\Nsave our lands from the Frost Giants?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.03,0:16:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.11,0:16:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's an NPC.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.45,0:16:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something strange\Nabout her, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.23,0:16:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her speech pattern doesn't\Nfollow the same set
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.85,0:16:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,response routines that\Na normal NPC's would.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.95,0:16:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her core programming is connected to\Nthe language engine module of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.71,0:16:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.85,0:16:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she some kind of AI?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.57,0:16:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Daddy, she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.39,0:16:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the past, Jotunheim was\Nsimilar to your Alfheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.03,0:16:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Covered in lush greenery\Nand beautiful lakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.39,0:16:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it basked in the blessings\Nof Yggdrasil, the world tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.37,0:16:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We, the hill giants, lived in peace and\Nharmony with our kinfolk, the creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Far below the splendor of Jotunheim is a\Nrealm of ice and snow known as Niflheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.25,0:16:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thrym, the king of the frost\Ngiants, rules that land.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.65,0:16:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He shattered our peace\Nby casting Excalibur,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.29,0:16:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sword that slices through wooden iron,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.05,0:17:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into the well of Oort,\Nthe heart of our land.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.79,0:17:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It severed the thickest\Nroots of the world tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.57,0:17:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In an instant, Jotunheim lost the\Nblessings it received from Yggdrasil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.83,0:17:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right, Excalibur.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Under Thrymmer's command,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.39,0:17:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Frost Giants marched on Jotunheim\Nand overwhelmed our defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.03,0:17:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their fortresses and castles\Nsoon blighted our land,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.25,0:17:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and scores of my people were\Ncaptured and imprisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.27,0:17:52.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once they seized control,\Nthey built Thrymheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.65,0:17:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their largest castle, atop the mass\Nof ice once known as the Well of Oort.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.77,0:18:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During the chaos, my sisters and I\Nescaped to the bottom of a frozen lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.93,0:18:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, we no longer have\Nthe power we once had.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.95,0:18:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The frost giants are not\Nsatisfied with their spoils.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.79,0:18:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They wish to annihilate our kin, the\Ncreatures that populate our realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.43,0:18:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they succeed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.99,0:18:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my powers will be extinguished, and\NThrymheim will rise to the next world,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.89,0:18:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your world, Alfheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.95,0:18:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.19,0:18:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're telling us that\Nonce they're done here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.09,0:18:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're going to go up and destroy Arun?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.07,0:18:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that is their intention.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.51,0:18:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King Thrym will seal Alfheim in ice and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.03,0:18:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,continue on until he reaches\Nthe top of Yggdrasil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.41,0:18:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once he reaches it, he will take\Nthe golden apple growing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.25,0:18:51.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thrym and his generals\Nhave grown frustrated
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.65,0:18:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by the time it is taking\Nto wipe out my kinfolk,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.41,0:18:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they have turned to your people,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.25,0:18:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the fairies, for assistance\Nin their murderous plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.89,0:19:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your kind hunts our kinfolk to extinction,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.91,0:19:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lured by the offer of\NExcalibur as a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.77,0:19:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, King Thrymmer cannot\Nbestow that sword onto others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.03,0:19:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For if Excalibur ever leaves Thrymheim,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.13,0:19:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the blessings of Yggdrasil\Nwill return to this land,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.31,0:19:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and their castle will vanish\Nas a mist upon a meadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.17,0:19:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, what kind of quest is it\Nwhen the reward forward is a total lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.41,0:19:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is he going to get away with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.67,0:19:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most likely,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he will award the victor\Na sword called Caliburn,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.03,0:19:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whose appearance is\Nidentical to Excalibur.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.97,0:19:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.33,0:19:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's a king, doesn't\Nhe have a code of honor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.07,0:19:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, cheating and falsehoods\Nare Thrimmer's most powerful assets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.03,0:19:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, he has made one great mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.21,0:19:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In his eagerness to slaughter my kin,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.85,0:19:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he has sent a number\Nof his giants down from
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.21,0:19:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thrymheim to marshal your kind for battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.53,0:20:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this moment, the defenses of his castle\Nare weaker than they have ever been.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.05,0:20:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's our shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.45,0:20:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the stone in the amulet turns black,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.45,0:20:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it will mean all my kinfolk have been\Nslain, and my powers have left me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.91,0:20:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good fairies, infiltrate Thrymheim,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.11,0:20:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remove Excalibur from its\Nplinth, and save my realm.
