Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.99,0:20:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am counting on you, good fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.91,0:20:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is turning into a\Nbigger deal than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.19,0:20:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this still considered a quest?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.69,0:20:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it's kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.29,0:20:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,turned into something way more\Nepic than a plain old quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.01,0:20:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.21,0:20:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said if the creatures in\Nthis world get killed off,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.91,0:21:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Frost Giants will take over\Nthe surface next. Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.23,0:21:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I doubt the Admins\Nwould let that happen
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.57,0:21:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without some kind of update\Nor warning or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.07,0:21:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, normally, they'd let\Nplayers know a week ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.53,0:21:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.44,0:21:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna finish this quest\Nfor Tonki, right, Kazuto?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.57,0:21:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.69,0:21:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were gonna storm the castle\Nand grab Excalibur anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.87,0:21:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be easy if the\Ncastle's defenses are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.83,0:21:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Helping Tonki and his\Nfriends out, that's a bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.91,0:21:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go, guys, our last\Nbig quest of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.95,0:21:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's bank this thing and score us a\Nspot on the front page of MMO tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.93,0:21:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.21,0:21:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, Tonki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.81,0:21:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get your home back for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.73,0:21:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be good as new, promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.51,0:22:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.61,0:22:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unique Loverty
